From: Christopher Owen <root@your.mom>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 23:35:52 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(deepseek-v41): write B12X contiguous cache records

---
 tests/models/test_deepseek_v41_b12x.py        | 119 ++++++++++++
 vllm/models/deepseek_v41/attention.py         |  11 +-
 .../deepseek_v41/nvidia/b12x_attention.py     | 179 +++++++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 305 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

